  "description": "Prototype evaluation set for PrivacyLens. Questions are annotated by hand against the fictional Brightleaf Notes demo policy (data/sample_policy.txt). Supporting passages are identified by section-heading substrings so annotations survive changes to chunk size. 'expected_status' is the evidence status a careful reader would assign; 'answer_must_mention' lists alternative phrasings, at least one of which a correct answer must contain (case-insensitive).",
  "policy": "data/sample_policy.txt",
